    {
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Why are two states enough? Every legal expression without parentheses is a signed sum of multiplication/division terms, each an integer power of x. A negative exponent denotes a fraction: 3^-1 = 1/3, written legally as 3/3/3. Add three such terms: 3/3/3 + 3/3/3 + 3/3/3 = 1. Replace them with 3/3: this is one fractional carry. In charged accounting, each old term has two division symbols plus one joining sign, so three terms cost 3 * 3 = 9. The replacement has one division plus one joining sign, costing 2. We charge every term a join here; remove the artificial leading join only once from the complete expression at the end. This example shows a cost reduction; the general argument is still needed. Cancel opposite terms of equal power. For an integer target, remaining negative-exponent terms must combine in groups of x and carry upward; otherwise a denominator remains. Replacing such a group by a higher power never costs more. Likewise, x same-sign units at any digit can be combined upward without increasing cost. Only two boundaries remain for the low digits: no borrowed higher unit, or one borrowed unit, represented by S and next power minus S. The four identities cover both boundaries, and every candidate constructs legal terms, so the minimum neither misses a solution nor undercounts. The first digit establishes this invariant (a statement true after every step); each update preserves it. After D digits compare p with n+D for adding x^D, then subtract 1."
    },
    {
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "为什么两种状态足够？无括号的合法表达式是若干带符号的乘除项；每项都等于 x 的整数次幂。负指数表示分数：例如 3^-1 = 1/3，合法写法是 3/3/3。三个这样的项相加：3/3/3 + 3/3/3 + 3/3/3 = 1，可以换成 3/3。这就是一次分数进位。按带连接符费用，每个旧项有两个除号和一个连接符，三项共 3 * 3 = 9；新项有一个除号和一个连接符，费用为 2。这里先给每项都记一个连接符；虚记的首项连接符只在完整表达式末尾去掉一次。这个例子说明费用下降，下面仍需一般论证。正负相同幂先抵消。对整数目标，剩余负指数的项必须凑成 x 个才能逐级进位，否则总值仍有分母；用更高的幂替换不会增加费用。任一位同号的 x 个单位也能合并到高位，费用不会增加。因此处理低位时，只需区分不向高位借一个单位和借一个单位，即 S 与下一幂减 S。上面四个恒等式涵盖了这两种边界情况，且每个候选都可用合法项构造；取最小既不漏解也不低估。初始最低位成立，逐位更新保持这个不变量（每步始终为真的陈述）。读完 D 位后，再比较直接 p 和补上 x^D 的 n+D，最后减 1。"
    }
